ang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"b64json-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"b64Json"}]},{"type":"code","value":"b64Json: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Base64-encoded asset data"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"url-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"url?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional url?: never;","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"union-members","text":"Union Members","level":2},{"id":"type-literal","text":"Type Literal","level":3},{"id":"b64json","text":"b64Json?","level":4},{"id":"url","text":"url","level":4},{"id":"type-literal-2","text":"Type Literal","level":3},{"id":"b64json-2","text":"b64Json","level":4},{"id":"url-2","text":"url?","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype GeneratedMediaSource = \n  | {\n  b64Json?: never;\n  url: string;\n}\n  | {\n  b64Json: string;\n  url?: never;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2189](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2189)\n\nSource of a generated media asset. Exactly one of `url` or `b64Json` is\npresent; the other is absent. Modeled as a mutually-exclusive union so the\ntype rejects `{}` and `{ url, b64Json }` together at compile time while\npreserving the flat `.url` / `.b64Json` access patterns.\n\n## Union Members\n\n### Type Literal\n\n```ts\n{\n  b64Json?: never;\n  url: string;\n}\n```\n\n#### b64Json?\n\n```ts\noptional b64Json?: never;\n```\n\n#### url\n\n```ts\nurl: string;\n```\n\nURL to the generated asset (may be temporary)\n\n***\n\n### Type Literal\n\n```ts\n{\n  b64Json: string;\n  url?: never;\n}\n```\n\n#### b64Json\n\n```ts\nb64Json: string;\n```\n\nBase64-encoded asset data\n\n#### url?\n\n```ts\noptional url?: never;\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: GeneratedMediaSource\ntitle: GeneratedMediaSource\n---\n\n```ts\ntype GeneratedMediaSource = \n  | {\n  b64Json?: never;\n  url: string;\n}\n  | {\n  b64Json: string;\n  url?: never;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2189](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2189)\n\nSource of a generated media asset. Exactly one of `url` or `b64Json` is\npresent; the other is absent. Modeled as a mutually-exclusive union so the\ntype rejects `{}` and `{ url, b64Json }` together at compile time while\npreserving the flat `.url` / `.b64Json` access patterns.\n\n## Union Members\n\n### Type Literal\n\n```ts\n{\n  b64Json?: never;\n  url: string;\n}\n```\n\n#### b64Json?\n\n```ts\noptional b64Json?: never;\n```\n\n#### url\n\n```ts\nurl: string;\n```\n\nURL to the generated asset (may be temporary)\n\n***\n\n### Type Literal\n\n```ts\n{\n  b64Json: string;\n  url?: never;\n}\n```\n\n#### b64Json\n\n```ts\nb64Json: string;\n```\n\nBase64-encoded asset data\n\n#### url?\n\n```ts\noptional url?: never;\n```\n"}
